---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../config';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Use — fixme.vip"
  description="The terms for using fixme.vip's HVAC error-code guides, lookup tool and quote request form, including safety limits and affiliate disclosure."
  heading="Terms of Use"
  updated="2026-10-03"
>
  <p>
    By using fixme.vip you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site. Questions go to
    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>General information, not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Our guides explain what HVAC error codes usually mean and which checks are safe for a homeowner. They are
    general information. We cannot see your equipment, and code meanings vary by model and control board. Always
    check the label inside your unit and its manufacturer's manual.
  </p>
  <p>
    Gas furnaces, refrigerant and electrical work can cause fire, carbon monoxide poisoning, injury or death. Only a
    licensed technician should work inside the cabinet, on gas valves, on safety switches or on refrigerant.
    <strong>If you smell gas or a carbon monoxide alarm sounds, leave the building and call your gas utility or 911
    from outside.</strong>
  </p>

  <h2>AI-assisted content</h2>
  <p>
    Our guides are drafted with the help of AI tools and checked before publication, as described on our
    <a href="/about/">About page</a>. The AI diagnosis tool gives an automated answer that can be wrong. Treat it as a
    starting point, not a diagnosis.
  </p>

  <h2>Quote requests</h2>
  <p>
    The quote form is free and creates no obligation. We do not perform repairs. When you submit a request, we may
    pass it to independent contractors or home-services networks. Any work, price or warranty is agreed between you
    and them, and we are not a party to it. How we handle your details is set out in our
    <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    fixme.vip earns money from some links and referrals, including as an Amazon Associate from qualifying purchases,
    and from partners when a quote request is passed on. This does not change what our guides recommend.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    Don't misuse the site. That includes submitting false or someone else's details, automated scraping that
    burdens the site, or attempts to break its security.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty; limit of liability</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the extent the law allows, fixme.vip is not
    liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the site or from acting on its content, including work
